Package: kanban
Version: 0.1.0
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: jmh-devel
Depends: git, gh
Description: Lightweight GitHub issue board CLI.
 Detects the active git repo from the current working directory,
 resolves the GitHub slug from the origin remote, fetches milestones
 and open issues through the GitHub CLI, and renders a board in the
 terminal or through a local web server.
